From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hilman <hilman@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 21:18:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] cmake: raise minimum version for CMake 4

CMake 4 removed compatibility with projects declaring a minimum below 3.5.
The libyaml build does not rely on behavior older than that baseline.
---
 CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 4f81148..8888888 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.0)
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.5)
 project (yaml C)
 
 set (YAML_VERSION_MAJOR 0)
-- 
2.43.0
